.daml/
*.dar
!daml/dars/*.dar
target/
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.idea/

# LocalNet runtime output
infra/localnet/log/
infra/localnet/demo/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
infra/devnet/participants.json
infra/devnet/ui.json
infra/devnet/demo/
# BitSafe's sandbox config, which carries its bundled tokens. Committed as
# *.example.json with the tokens replaced, the same way infra/devnet/ does it.
infra/bitsafe/participants.json
infra/bitsafe/ui.json
infra/bitsafe/demo/
infra/bitsafe/log/

# The Decentralization Manager's bearer token, pasted in by the operator so
# the dev server can read the vote and execute. A credential: never committed,
# and never sent to the browser.
infra/*/decman-token.txt
infra/*/decman-refresh.txt
infra/*/ca.pem
infra/*/truststore.jks

# Internal working documents, never committed (briefs, messages, private notes).
private/

# Claude Code working context: read from disk, never committed.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# The 18 September backup of the working context; the live file is CLAUDE.md.
CLAUDE-backup.md
# A local TLS-interception root (Norton on this machine), exported so the
# Java gRPC client will trust the proxied certificate. Machine-specific.
infra/*/ca.pem
infra/*/public/
ui/dist/
quickstart/.cache/
# Scratch from driving the quickstart stack from a shell (party maps, a
# bundled settle, an endpoint list): generated, never committed. Named for the
# seat tag, which defaults to "demo".
# Generated per seat, in a directory named for the seat tag. Ignored by name
# rather than by directory, so renaming the tag cannot quietly expose them
# again - which is exactly what happened when "judge" became "demo".
infra/*/participants-with-parties.json
infra/*/prepared.json
infra/*/settle.mjs
infra/*/seat.json
infra/demo/
infra/judge/

# The pitch deck and its speaker notes. Kept on disk, deliberately out of the
# repository: the PDF is what goes to the submission platform, the pptx is
# where it is edited, deck.html is the browser version, and pitch.md is what
# to say over each slide. Four copies of one deck drifted for a week while
# they were tracked, and none of them is code.
docs/deck.html
docs/pitch.md
docs/Indivisa-pitch.pptx
docs/Indivisa-pitch.pdf

# One editor preference (unpacked DARs read-only). Not project material.
.vscode/
